<title>USA: Valspar to acquire coatings manufacturer.</title>
<headline>Valspar to acquire coatings manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp said Wednesday it agreed to acquire  Sureguard Inc, an industrial coatings manufacturer with 1996 revenues of $10 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which is expected to be completed by the end of January, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Sureguard is headquartered in Grand Prairie, Texas.</p>
<p>Valspar manufactures paints and coatings.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
